@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] saved-frame-tailwind-coverage
The Tailwind build MUST emit the frozen V3 utility vocabulary, including utilities absent from local
components. Saved Frames are loaded at runtime and cannot be scanned during the build.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] legacy-opacity-overrides-are-opt-in
Compatibility color overrides MUST require a matching legacy opacity class on the utility owner.
Divider overrides MUST target the same children as V4's divider widths. Placeholder overrides MUST
target the placeholder pseudo-element. Ordinary V4 colors without legacy opacity classes MUST NOT
match these overrides.
